# Vector arithmetic and quaternion-backed rotation.

import vector.dl
import quaternion.dl

function the vector component width of {a 32 bit floating-point number:value}:
    replacement:
        "float32"

function the vector component width of {a 64 bit floating-point number:value}:
    replacement:
        "float64"

set left to a new vector with x (-1.5) as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 2.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 3.25 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set right to a new vector with x 2.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y (-4.0) as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 0.5 as a 32 bit floating-point number
print the vector component width of (the x of (left + right)) as a line
print left + right as a line
print left - right as a line
print left * right as a line
print left / right as a line
set floatFactor to 2.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
print the vector component width of (the x of (left * floatFactor)) as a line
print left * floatFactor as a line
print floatFactor * left as a line
print the vector component width of (the x of (left / floatFactor)) as a line
print left / floatFactor as a line
print the dot product of left and right as a line
print the cross product of left and right as a line
print the squared length of left as a line
print (the length of left) as a line
set normalizedLeft to left normalized
print the vector component width of (the x of normalizedLeft) as a line
print normalizedLeft as a line
set zero to a new vector with x 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set normalizedZero to zero normalized
print the vector component width of (the x of normalizedZero) as a line
print normalizedZero as a line
set mixedVector to a new vector with x 3.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y -4.0 and z 5.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set mixedNormalized to mixedVector normalized
print the vector component width of (the x of mixedNormalized) as a line
print the vector component width of (the y of mixedNormalized) as a line
print the vector component width of (the z of mixedNormalized) as a line
print mixedNormalized as a line
set mixedZeroVector to a new vector with x 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 and z 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set mixedZeroNormalized to mixedZeroVector normalized
print the vector component width of (the x of mixedZeroNormalized) as a line
print the vector component width of (the y of mixedZeroNormalized) as a line
print the vector component width of (the z of mixedZeroNormalized) as a line
print mixedZeroNormalized as a line

set doubleVector to a new vector with x -1.25, y 2.5 and z -4.75
print the vector component width of (the x of (doubleVector * 2.0)) as a line
print doubleVector * 2.0 as a line
print the dot product of doubleVector and doubleVector as a line

set turn to a quaternion for rotation around (a new vector with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 1.0) by 90.0 degrees
set rotated to (a new vector with x 1.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0) rotated by turn
print rotated as a line
set floatAxis to a new vector with x 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 1.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set floatAngle to 90.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set floatAxisTurn to a quaternion for rotation around floatAxis by floatAngle degrees
set rawFloatQuaternion to a new quaternion with w 0.70710677 as a 32 bit floating-point number, x 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 0.70710677 as a 32 bit floating-point number
print the vector component width of (the x of (rawFloatQuaternion normalized)) as a line
print the vector component width of (the x of floatAxisTurn) as a line
set floatAxisRotated to (a new vector with x 1.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) rotated around floatAxis by floatAngle degrees
print the vector component width of (the x of floatAxisRotated) as a line
print floatAxisRotated as a line
set integerRotated to (a new vector with x 1.0, y 0.0 and z 0.0) rotated around floatAxis by 90 degrees
print the vector component width of (the x of integerRotated) as a line
print integerRotated as a line
set mixedAxis to a new vector with x 0.0, y 0.0 and z 1.0
set mixedAxisTurn to a quaternion for rotation around mixedAxis by floatAngle degrees
print the vector component width of (the x of mixedAxisTurn) as a line
set mixedAngleTurn to a quaternion for rotation around floatAxis by 90.0 degrees
set unsignedAngleTurn to a quaternion for rotation around floatAxis by 90 as a 32 bit unsigned integer degrees
print the w of unsignedAngleTurn as a line
print the vector component width of (the x of mixedAngleTurn) as a line
set floatTurn to a new quaternion with w 0.70710677 as a 32 bit floating-point number, x 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 0.70710677 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set floatRotated to (a new vector with x 1.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) rotated by floatTurn
print the vector component width of (the x of floatRotated) as a line
print floatRotated as a line
set zeroQuaternion to a new quaternion with w 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, x 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set normalizedZeroQuaternion to zeroQuaternion normalized
set inverseZeroQuaternion to the inverse of zeroQuaternion
print the vector component width of (the x of normalizedZeroQuaternion) as a line
print the vector component width of (the x of inverseZeroQuaternion) as a line
print normalizedZeroQuaternion as a line
print inverseZeroQuaternion as a line
set mixedQuaternion to a new quaternion with w 1.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, x (-2.0), y 3.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z (-4.0) as a 32 bit floating-point number
set mixedNormalizedQuaternion to mixedQuaternion normalized
set mixedInverseQuaternion to the inverse of mixedQuaternion
print the vector component width of (the w of mixedNormalizedQuaternion) as a line
print the vector component width of (the x of mixedNormalizedQuaternion) as a line
print the vector component width of (the y of mixedNormalizedQuaternion) as a line
print the vector component width of (the z of mixedNormalizedQuaternion) as a line
print mixedNormalizedQuaternion as a line
print the vector component width of (the x of mixedInverseQuaternion) as a line
print mixedInverseQuaternion as a line
set mixedZeroQuaternion to a new quaternion with w 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, x (0.0), y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z (0.0) as a 32 bit floating-point number
set mixedZeroNormalizedQuaternion to mixedZeroQuaternion normalized
set mixedZeroInverseQuaternion to the inverse of mixedZeroQuaternion
print the vector component width of (the w of mixedZeroNormalizedQuaternion) as a line
print the vector component width of (the x of mixedZeroNormalizedQuaternion) as a line
print the vector component width of (the y of mixedZeroNormalizedQuaternion) as a line
print the vector component width of (the z of mixedZeroNormalizedQuaternion) as a line
print mixedZeroNormalizedQuaternion as a line
print the vector component width of (the x of mixedZeroInverseQuaternion) as a line
print mixedZeroInverseQuaternion as a line
set nonUnitTurn to a new quaternion with w 2.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, x 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 2.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number
set nonUnitRotated to (a new vector with x 1.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number, y 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number and z 0.0 as a 32 bit floating-point number) rotated by nonUnitTurn
print the vector component width of (the x of nonUnitRotated) as a line
print nonUnitRotated as a line
set baseQuaternion to a new quaternion with w 1.0, x -2.0, y 3.0 and z -4.0
print baseQuaternion normalized as a line
print the conjugate of baseQuaternion as a line
print the inverse of baseQuaternion as a line
